---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Aleksander Adamowski - About Me">
  <main>
    <h1>About me</h1>
    <p>
      I'm a technology professional with years of experience in a wide array of
      domains - software engineering, system administration, full-stack
      software development, with a focus on information security.
    </p>
    <p>Happily married with 2 kids.</p>
    <p>
      In my free time, I like to exercise (I love HIIT/Tabata and heavy
      lifting), hike, sing karaoke, and play video games with friends and my
      kids. Occasionally, I come back to learning playing guitar (a pandemic
      era ambition).
    </p>
    <p>
      I maintain a set of custom-built karaoke machines based on Raspberry Pi
      and <a href="https://github.com/aadamowski/pikaraoke">pikaraoke</a> and
      I've been experimenting with using AI models for cleaning up, <a
      href="https://github.com/aadamowski/ITO-Master">remastering audio</a> and
      performing <a
      href="https://github.com/aadamowski/ultimatevocalremovergui">voice
      removal</a> and <a
      href="https://github.com/aadamowski/scripts/commit/86b6f2b375c86cdf871db4a46c82b2fc8483638f">automatic
      subtitling</a> for karaoke tracks.
    </p>
    <p>
      I like to play with small scale machine learning (the kind that can fit
      on my personal nVidia RTX 4090 with 24 GB of VRAM). Recently, I've
      completed Andrej Karpathy's "<a
      href="https://karpathy.ai/zero-to-hero.html">Neural Networks: Zero to Hero</a>"
      course on deep learning, building custom models starting from a
      Single-Layer Perceptron, up to a small scale Generative Pre-Trained
      Transformer (GPT).
    </p>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
